Cell["\<\
Using the NCcross function and symmetrizing in the two variables L and p, we \
work with\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.499998165100471*^9, 3.4999981866131268`*^9}, {
   3.517412337918914*^9, 3.517412343741897*^9}, 3.517412405762785*^9, {
